    16	
    17	Cael third. He had drafted his the night before and copied it fair on the counter at dawn, and the copying had taken a quarter of an hour for four clauses because he had found himself reading each one entirely, the way you read a thing you are never going to be inside again. He signed, and Bracken initialed, and there it was: the demonstration-provision enrollment, the one the whole continent had spent a term arguing about, closed by the four-clause form a homesick first-year uses.
    18	
